        {
          "id": 402040968,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@pquantin \nRegarding \"The change is so big that Gitlab does not render the diff, preventing any kind of review.\", I also noticed it. But I suspect it is caused by the big file (over 12,000 lines), not the big change. So it may not be solved even after splitting the change into 3 parts as you suggested. Do you have a way to contact Wireshark administrator and see if it can be configured to support reviewing such a big file?",
